<title>USA: Barr Labs distributes 7 mln shrs from split.</title>
<headline>Barr Labs distributes 7 mln shrs from split.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, N.Y. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Laboratories Inc said Wednesday it distributed about seven million additional shares of common stock, resulting from the three-for-two stock split that Barr announced on April 14.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the stock split was effected through a 50 percent stock dividend for shareholders of record as of April 24.</p>
<p>Fractional share amounts resulting from the split are being paid to shareholders in cash. It is Barr's second stock dividend in two years.</p>
<p>Beginning Thursday, Barr Laboratories stock will begin trading at the adjusted price.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
